Description:It is your first main phase. You have Searing Touch (1 damage to any target; buyback {4}) in hand with six red mana floating. The opponent is at 2 life and controls no creatures. Reduce the opponent to 0 life this turn.
Rule:authored-buyback-order | A spell cast with buyback returns to its owner's hand as it resolves instead of going to the graveyard (CR 702.27a): cast it with buyback first (five mana), then again normally (one mana) for 2 damage; cast normally first, it goes to the graveyard and the remaining five mana do nothing
